{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-38549","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-42692","text":"FleetPrompt — Implementation Build Prompt"}]},{"id":"blk-38550","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42693","marks":["bold"],"text":"Version:"},{"id":"spn-42694","text":" 1.0 | "},{"id":"spn-42695","marks":["bold"],"text":"Date:"},{"id":"spn-42696","text":" April 2026 | "},{"id":"spn-42697","marks":["bold"],"text":"Type:"},{"id":"spn-42698","text":" Full Implementation (Phoenix + OTP + Supabase)"}]},{"id":"blk-38551","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42699","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-38552","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-42700","text":"Your Mission"}]},{"id":"blk-38553","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42701","text":"You are building "},{"id":"spn-42702","marks":["bold"],"text":"FleetPrompt"},{"id":"spn-42703","text":" — the open agent marketplace for the [&] Protocol ecosystem. FleetPrompt is the registry where production-ready AI agents are published, discovered, and deployed in one click. Every listed agent carries a versioned manifest, a computed trust score, declared permissions, and a linked SpecPrompt spec."}]},{"id":"blk-38554","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42704","marks":["bold"],"text":"Read `docs/spec/README.md` fully before writing a single line."},{"id":"spn-42705","text":" It is the authoritative spec."}]},{"id":"blk-38555","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42706","text":"FleetPrompt is the "},{"id":"spn-42707","marks":["bold"],"text":"distribution layer"},{"id":"spn-42708","text":" of the dark factory pipeline:"}]},{"id":"blk-38556","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"SpecPrompt (spec in) → Agentelic (build) → OS-008 (enforce) → FleetPrompt (distribute) → RuneFort (observe)"},{"id":"blk-38557","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42709","text":"FleetPrompt is also the "},{"id":"spn-42710","marks":["bold"],"text":"canonical trust broker"},{"id":"spn-42711","text":" of the [&] ecosystem — it aggregates PRISM CL scores, test coverage, usage data, and audit quality into a single trust score."}]},{"id":"blk-38558","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42712","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-38559","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-42713","text":"Target Stack"}]},{"id":"blk-38560","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Language:     Elixir 1.17+ / OTP 27\nFramework:    Phoenix 1.8+ (LiveView for real-time search, PubSub for trust broadcasts)\nDatabase:     PostgreSQL via shared Supabase (fleet.* schema, migration range 030-039)\nSearch:       pg_trgm + ts_vector (no external search infra)\nHot Cache:    ETS (:fp_manifests, :fp_trust_scores, :fp_search_index, :fp_categories)\nAudit:        Broadway pipeline (batched, append-only)\nBackground:   Oban (trust recompute, webhook delivery, search index refresh)\nAuth:         Supabase Auth (shared [&] ecosystem — amp.profiles, amp.workspaces)\nTelemetry:    :telemetry + Prometheus\nDeploy:       Mix release + Docker on Fly.io"},{"id":"blk-38561","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42714","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-38562","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-42715","text":"Repository Structure"}]},{"id":"blk-38563","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42716","text":"Create this structure inside "},{"id":"spn-42717","marks":["code"],"text":"fleetprompt.com/"},{"id":"spn-42718","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-38564","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"fleetprompt.com/\n├── lib/\n│   ├── fleet_prompt/\n│   │   ├── agents/\n│   │   │   └── agent.ex               # FleetPrompt.Agents.Agent schema (fleet.agents)\n│   │   ├── manifests/\n│   │   │   └── manifest.ex            # FleetPrompt.Manifests.Manifest schema (fleet.manifests)\n│   │   ├── publishers/\n│   │   │   └── publisher.ex           # FleetPrompt.Publishers.Publisher schema (fleet.publishers)\n│   │   ├── installs/\n│   │   │   └── install.ex             # FleetPrompt.Installs.Install schema (fleet.installs)\n│   │   ├── trust/\n│   │   │   ├── engine.ex              # FleetPrompt.TrustEngine — 4-signal score computation\n│   │   │   ├── worker.ex              # FleetPrompt.TrustWorker — GenServer per agent\n│   │   │   └── supervisor.ex          # FleetPrompt.TrustSupervisor — DynamicSupervisor\n│   │   ├── registry.ex                # FleetPrompt.Registry — manifest CRUD, version management\n│   │   ├── search/\n│   │   │   ├── index.ex               # FleetPrompt.SearchIndex — pg_trgm + ts_vector management\n│   │   │   └── query.ex               # FleetPrompt.Search — search query builder\n│   │   ├── forks.ex                   # FleetPrompt.Forks — fork-and-customize workflow\n│   │   ├── install_engine.ex          # FleetPrompt.InstallEngine — deploy orchestration\n│   │   ├── audit_writer.ex            # FleetPrompt.AuditWriter — Broadway append-only audit\n│   │   ├── webhook_dispatcher.ex      # FleetPrompt.WebhookDispatcher — Oban async webhooks\n│   │   ├── pipeline_intake.ex         # FleetPrompt.PipelineIntake — dark factory event handler\n│   │   └── mcp/\n│   │       ├── server.ex              # MCP JSON-RPC server (section 11)\n│   │       └── tools.ex               # Tool definitions and handlers\n│   ├── fleet_prompt.ex                # Application entry point\n│   └── fleet_prompt_web/\n│       ├── router.ex                  # Phoenix router\n│       ├── live/\n│       │   ├── search_live.ex         # LiveView — agent search (⌘K)\n│       │   ├── agent_detail_live.ex   # LiveView — agent detail + manifest\n│       │   ├── trust_dashboard_live.ex # LiveView — trust score dashboard\n│       │   └── publisher_live.ex      # LiveView — publisher profile\n│       └── controllers/\n│           ├── api_controller.ex      # REST API for programmatic access\n│           └── webhook_controller.ex  # POST /api/pipeline/intake (CloudEvents)\n├── test/\n│   ├── trust/\n│   │   ├── engine_test.exs\n│   │   └── worker_test.exs\n│   ├── search/\n│   │   ├── index_test.exs\n│   │   └── query_test.exs\n│   ├── pipeline_intake_test.exs\n│   ├── forks_test.exs\n│   └── fixtures/\n│       ├── customer_support_manifest.json\n│       └── consolidation_event.json\n├── mix.exs\n├── Dockerfile\n└── fly.toml"},{"id":"blk-38565","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42719","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-38566","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-42720","text":"Implementation Order"}]},{"id":"blk-38567","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-42721","text":"Phase 1: Core Registry (weeks 1-6)"}]},{"id":"blk-38568","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42722","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-42723","marks":["bold"],"text":"Set up Phoenix project"},{"id":"spn-42724","text":" with Ecto, Supabase config, LiveView 2. "},{"id":"spn-42725","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement Ecto schemas"},{"id":"spn-42726","text":" (sections 3-4)"}]},{"id":"blk-38569","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38571","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42727","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Publishers.Publisher"},{"id":"spn-42728","text":" with workspace_id, user_id (Supabase Auth)"}]}],"id":"blk-38570","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38573","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42729","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Agents.Agent"},{"id":"spn-42730","text":" with workspace_id, search_vector"}]}],"id":"blk-38572","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38575","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42731","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Manifests.Manifest"},{"id":"spn-42732","text":" with all fields from section 4.1"}]}],"id":"blk-38574","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38577","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42733","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Installs.Install"},{"id":"spn-42734","text":" with workspace_id"}]}],"id":"blk-38576","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38579","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42735","text":"Audit events schema with workspace_id"}]}],"id":"blk-38578","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-38580","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42736","text":"3. "},{"id":"spn-42737","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement Registry"},{"id":"spn-42738","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-42739","marks":["code"],"text":"registry.ex"},{"id":"spn-42740","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-38581","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38583","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42741","text":"Manifest CRUD with version immutability"}]}],"id":"blk-38582","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38585","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42742","text":"Version management (semver enforcement)"}]}],"id":"blk-38584","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38587","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42743","text":"Status transitions: draft → published → deprecated → yanked"}]}],"id":"blk-38586","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-38588","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42744","text":"4. "},{"id":"spn-42745","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement ETS caches"}]},{"id":"blk-38589","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38591","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42746","marks":["code"],"text":":fp_manifests"},{"id":"spn-42747","text":" — agent_id:version → manifest map"}]}],"id":"blk-38590","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38593","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42748","marks":["code"],"text":":fp_trust_scores"},{"id":"spn-42749","text":" — agent_id → {score, computed_at}"}]}],"id":"blk-38592","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38595","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42750","marks":["code"],"text":":fp_search_index"},{"id":"spn-42751","text":" — trigram → [agent_id]"}]}],"id":"blk-38594","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38597","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42752","marks":["code"],"text":":fp_categories"},{"id":"spn-42753","text":" — category_slug → [agent_id]"}]}],"id":"blk-38596","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-38598","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-42754","text":"Phase 2: Trust Engine (weeks 4-8)"}]},{"id":"blk-38599","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42755","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-42756","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement TrustEngine"},{"id":"spn-42757","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-42758","marks":["code"],"text":"trust/engine.ex"},{"id":"spn-42759","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-38600","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38602","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42760","text":"4 weighted signals: test_coverage (30%), spec_compliance (25%), usage_history (25%), audit_quality (20%)"}]}],"id":"blk-38601","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38604","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42761","marks":["code"],"text":"compute/1"},{"id":"spn-42762","text":" → integer 0-100"}]}],"id":"blk-38603","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38606","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42763","text":"Individual signal computations from section 5.1"}]}],"id":"blk-38605","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-38607","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42764","text":"2. "},{"id":"spn-42765","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement TrustWorker"},{"id":"spn-42766","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-42767","marks":["code"],"text":"trust/worker.ex"},{"id":"spn-42768","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-38608","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38610","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42769","text":"GenServer per agent"}]}],"id":"blk-38609","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38612","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42770","text":"Computes initial score on publish"}]}],"id":"blk-38611","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38614","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42771","text":"Recomputes on new data (installs, test results, audits)"}]}],"id":"blk-38613","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38616","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42772","text":"Caches in ETS"}]}],"id":"blk-38615","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38618","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42773","text":"Broadcasts via PubSub"}]}],"id":"blk-38617","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38620","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42774","text":"Hibernates after 5 minutes inactivity"}]}],"id":"blk-38619","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-38621","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42775","text":"3. "},{"id":"spn-42776","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement TrustSupervisor"},{"id":"spn-42777","text":" — DynamicSupervisor managing TrustWorkers"}]},{"id":"blk-38622","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-42778","text":"Phase 3: Search (weeks 6-10)"}]},{"id":"blk-38623","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42779","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-42780","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement full-text search"},{"id":"spn-42781","text":" (section 8)"}]},{"id":"blk-38624","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38626","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42782","text":"ts_vector generated column on agents (name A, description B, tags C)"}]}],"id":"blk-38625","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38628","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42783","text":"pg_trgm fuzzy matching indexes"}]}],"id":"blk-38627","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38630","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42784","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Search.search/2"},{"id":"spn-42785","text":" with filters: min_trust, category, runtime, limit"}]}],"id":"blk-38629","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38632","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42786","text":"Ranking: ts_rank descending, then trust_score descending"}]}],"id":"blk-38631","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-38633","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-42787","text":"Phase 4: Publish Pipeline (weeks 8-12)"}]},{"id":"blk-38634","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42788","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-42789","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement publish flow"},{"id":"spn-42790","text":" (section 6)"}]},{"id":"blk-38635","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38637","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42791","text":"Manifest validation → spec validation → duplicate check → trust computation → index update → audit + notify"}]}],"id":"blk-38636","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38639","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42792","text":"Version immutability enforcement"}]}],"id":"blk-38638","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38641","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42793","text":"Yank support (hides from search, preserves record)"}]}],"id":"blk-38640","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-38642","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42794","text":"2. "},{"id":"spn-42795","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement AuditWriter"},{"id":"spn-42796","text":" — Broadway pipeline for batched audit writes 3. "},{"id":"spn-42797","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement WebhookDispatcher"},{"id":"spn-42798","text":" — Oban worker for async webhook delivery with retry/backoff"}]},{"id":"blk-38643","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-42799","text":"Phase 5: Install Pipeline (weeks 10-14)"}]},{"id":"blk-38644","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42800","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-42801","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement install flow"},{"id":"spn-42802","text":" (section 7)"}]},{"id":"blk-38645","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38647","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42803","text":"Permission review → Delegatic policy check → MCP dependency resolution → OpenSentience deploy → Graphonomous connect → audit + confirm"}]}],"id":"blk-38646","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-38648","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42804","text":"2. "},{"id":"spn-42805","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement InstallEngine"},{"id":"spn-42806","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-42807","marks":["code"],"text":"install_engine.ex"},{"id":"spn-42808","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-38649","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38651","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42809","text":"Permission sandboxing (section 7.2)"}]}],"id":"blk-38650","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38653","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42810","text":"Delegatic org-level denylists"}]}],"id":"blk-38652","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-38654","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42811","text":"3. "},{"id":"spn-42812","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement Fork System"},{"id":"spn-42813","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-42814","marks":["code"],"text":"forks.ex"},{"id":"spn-42815","text":") — section 9"}]},{"id":"blk-38655","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38657","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42816","text":"Fork creates new agent under forker's account"}]}],"id":"blk-38656","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38659","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42817","marks":["code"],"text":"forked_from"},{"id":"spn-42818","text":" provenance tracking"}]}],"id":"blk-38658","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38661","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42819","text":"Trust score starts at 0 for forks"}]}],"id":"blk-38660","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-38662","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-42820","text":"Phase 6: Dark Factory Pipeline Intake (weeks 12-16)"}]},{"id":"blk-38663","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42821","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-42822","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement PipelineIntake"},{"id":"spn-42823","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-42824","marks":["code"],"text":"pipeline_intake.ex"},{"id":"spn-42825","text":") — section 10.2"}]},{"id":"blk-38664","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38666","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42826","text":"Accept "},{"id":"spn-42827","marks":["code"],"text":"ConsolidationEvent"},{"id":"spn-42828","text":" from Agentelic at "},{"id":"spn-42829","marks":["code"],"text":"POST /api/pipeline/intake"}]}],"id":"blk-38665","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38668","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42830","text":"Event validation: CloudEvents envelope, workspace_id, artifact_hash"}]}],"id":"blk-38667","kind":"list-